cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite the paper, and cite the archived data by its DOI."
title: "SimGlot: Oracle-Integrity Auditing and Configuration-Dependent Measurement in an LLM Agent Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Artifact for an empirical study that treats an LLM agent benchmark's evaluation harness --
  its task suite, input generator and reward function -- as software under test. It contains the
  oracle-integrity auditing suite (eight checks in two families), a twenty-one-variant
  fault-injection battery over seven defect classes, the analyses behind every table and figure in
  the paper, and the version-binding records that tie each number to a frozen archive revision.
